; ==============================================================
; Practical 9 : Register-reference instructions CIR, CIL
; Machine : BasicComputer.cpu (Mano's Basic Computer)
; CIR : circulate E and AC right (E -> AC(15), AC(0) -> E)
; CIL : circulate E and AC left (AC(15) -> E, E -> AC(0))
; ==============================================================

LDA NUM
CIR
CIR
CIL
CIL
HLT
NUM: .data 1 9
